# Specialist-phase audit trail for the Sandcastle adoption work (security plan-audit
# verdict + re-audit, performance post-run audit). Tracked as decision provenance for
# the major-severity pre-exec gate resolution + minor post-run informational audit.
!.pHive/specialist-phases/
.pHive/specialist-phases/*
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/sandcastle-adoption-followon/
